{% call note("info", "Good to know", "Sequence is not the same as cause") %}<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If you changed something, record it. “I restarted the router and it worked afterwards” describes an order of events; it does not establish why the problem happened.</p>{% endcall %}
<h2 class="ed-section-heading" id="facts"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span>Keep facts separate from guesses</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A fictional example:</p>
{% call note("info", "Example only", "Describe what you observed") %}
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Tuesday, about 6:40 pm: the laptop's call froze in the study for roughly a minute. I did not check another device. The call resumed without me changing anything. I do not know whether other websites worked.</p>
{% endcall %}
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">That is more useful than “The whole network failed again” when the only observation came from one call. Our <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/guides/wifi-one-device-or-all/">two-device guide</a> explains how to add a fair comparison if the opportunity arises.</p>
<h2 class="ed-section-heading" id="pattern"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span>Review for a pattern</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">After a few ordinary incidents, look for repeated rooms, devices, activities or times. Do not invent a pattern from a single row, and keep contradictory observations. A quiet period is worth noting, but it does not prove the underlying issue has disappeared.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If you decide to measure the connection, keep those results alongside the diary using the <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/guides/connection-test-results/">connection-test guide</a>. Do not let repeated tests become the main use of your internet connection. For location comparisons, use the <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/guides/wifi-coverage-or-internet-service/">coverage worksheet</a>.</p>
<h2 class="ed-section-heading" id="share"><span aria-hidden="true">04</span>Share only what helps</h2>
{% call note("care", "Take care", "Keep private details out") %}<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Remove passwords, account identifiers, private conversations and unrelated screenshots. A plain-language summary is enough for an initial enquiry. Keep the original diary yourself so you can answer a follow-up question without sending everything at once.</p>{% endcall %}
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">You do not need a week's worth of evidence before reporting an outage to your internet provider or asking for help. If the issue disrupts your normal use, explain that and provide whatever observations you have.</p>

